      "locked": false,
      "id": "txt71",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 1336,
      "width": 427.46,
      "height": 82.5,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "text": "Optional. Creates the `Workflow.Invoke` app role and the api://\nidentifier URI, and assigns the role to the Web UI identity so\norchestrator endpoints require a managed-identity bearer token.\nDisabled here: this tenant forbids the required directory objects,\nso ENABLE_SERVICE_AUTH=false and ALLOW_INSECURE_SERVICE_AUTH=true \u2014\nwhich is why the orchestrator is internal-ingress only.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Optional. Creates the `Workflow.Invoke` app role and the api://\nidentifier URI, and assigns the role to the Web UI identity so\norchestrator endpoints require a managed-identity bearer token.\nDisabled here: this tenant forbids the required directory objects,\nso ENABLE_SERVICE_AUTH=false and ALLOW_INSECURE_SERVICE_AUTH=true \u2014\nwhich is why the orchestrator is internal-ingress only.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "roundness": null
    },
