      "width": 612.4799999999999,
      "height": 55.0,
      "strokeColor": "#5f6b7a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "text": "VNet 10.42.0.0/16. When enabled, the Container Apps environment joins the delegated subnet, the\nPostgreSQL server moves to a private endpoint with public access disabled, and the broad\nAllowAzureServices firewall rule is removed. Foundry and the registry stay on public endpoints \u2014\nthere are no private endpoints for them in this stack.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "VNet 10.42.0.0/16. When enabled, the Container Apps environment joins the delegated subnet, the\nPostgreSQL server moves to a private endpoint with public access disabled, and the broad\nAllowAzureServices firewall rule is removed. Foundry and the registry stay on public endpoints \u2014\nthere are no private endpoints for them in this stack.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "roundness": null
    },
